{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LWEZ4zgbrM1794885414.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>網上流傳一段車Cam影片，片主當時正駕車駛出一條行車隧道，旁邊行車線有一輛紅色的士行駛，令人震驚的是，該輛紅的車頭蓋竟然處於彈起打開的狀態，完全遮蓋整個擋風玻璃，但該名的士司機未有理會，依然如常行駛，而透過車窗更隱約可見車廂內疑載有乘客。惟車Cam顯示日期間2019年，明知是否一段舊片。</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-17-11h11m07s984.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sE4QJQ5Uc11794885446.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>片段上載至社交平台後迅速掀起網民熱烈討論，不少網民直言畫面恐怖，紛紛發留言熱議：「咁都睇到路」、「散熱好D慳氣D」、「老司機嘅技術」、「高手在民間」，更有網民質疑司機做法匪夷所思，留言表示：「 呢招係咩玩法？ 咁都仲可以繼續揸？」</p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-17-11h11m09s441.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026tVaJ4IZZtA1794885453.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.540318+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":260,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:30:39.306952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:01:15.392705+00:00","content_hash":"47112c4f3361d51923328a42a35390c77a20270f01d739f14795a6660fe4121a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:07:49.540318+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}